; A journal assert whose expression has trailing text is a parse error
; instead of asserting only the expression's first term.

assert 1 2

2024/01/05 Grocer
    Expenses:Food                 $15.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 4:
While parsing value expression:
  1 2
    ^
Error: Unexpected value '2'
end test
